From: Quillworks <updates@quillworks.example>
To: Sam Okafor <me@example.com>
Subject: Quillworks 3.2: offline sync and a faster editor
Date: @DATE@
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: multipart/alternative; boundary="quillworks-3-2"

--quillworks-3-2
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Quillworks 3.2 is out.

- Offline sync: write on the train, it catches up when you are back.
- The editor opens a 10,000-line document in under 80 ms.
- Comments now follow the text they are about when it moves.

Full release notes: https://quillworks.example/releases/3.2

--quillworks-3-2
